@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/recyclers
# JWT + RBAC: access token de un usuario con la concesión (401 sin token, 403 sin permiso).
@token = <access_token>

### getAll: lista solo recicladores activos
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### getOne: reciclador activo por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### getOne: id inexistente o inactivo -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### getOne: id inválido -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### sin Authorization -> 401 (authenticate)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### token de un rol sin la lectura (p. ej. PLANTA) -> 403 (authorize, deny by default)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
